<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines' SEC okays Bacnotan merger.</title>
<headline>Philippines' SEC okays Bacnotan merger.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) had approved the merger plan of Bacnotan Cement Corp and Central Cement Corp, Bacnotan said on Monday.</p>
<p>Corporate secretary Juan Diaz told the Philippine Stock Exchange that the merger certificate was received only last week, although the merger took effect on January 1.</p>
<p>Both Bacnotan and Central are members of Bacnotan Consolidated Inc.</p>
<p>The merger would increase Bacontan's annual clinker capacity to 1.25 million tonnes from the previous one million tonnes.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
